{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:19:46Z","thinking":"**Implementing Background Slicing**\n\nI'm now integrating background slicing into `js/app.js`. This involves using HTML5 Image/Canvas to handle the user's master image, `media_1787717941080.jpg` or a local asset. The goal is to crop the image into eight separate high-definition backgrounds for application.\n\n\n**Calculating Panel Coordinates**\n\nI've just calculated the precise coordinates for all eight background panels, referencing `media_1787717941080.jpg` based on the image's dimensions. These coordinates (sx, sy, sw, sh) will allow me to slice the master image into the necessary segments. I'll be directly mapping these panels to each screen element (#screen-1 through #screen-8).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * app.js - Main Controller for \\\"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\\\" (8 Levels)\\n * Tích hợp Background Wallpaper Slices từ Master Artwork & Thiết kế Đa Sắc Màu Rực Rỡ\\n */\\n\\nclass KidFlightApp {\\n    constructor() {\\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\\n        this.maxUnlockedLevel = 1;\\n        \\n        // Ngăn chặn duplicate event listeners khi quay lại màn\\n        this.levelInitialized = {\\n            1: false, 2: false, 3: false, 4: false,\\n            5: false, 6: false, 7: false, 8: false\\n        };\\n\\n        // Trạng thái các Level\\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\\n        this.level3Steps = { pass: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\\n        this.level4SelectedChar = null;\\n        this.level4Connections = { rabbit: false, bear: false, bin: false, dino: false };\\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, earRelieved: false };\\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, le